    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">Step 4(b) - Deductions Worksheet (Keep for your records.)</h2>
      <p>Enter an estimate of your 2022 itemized deductions (from Schedule A (Form 1040)). Such deductions may include mortgage interest, charitable contributions, state and local taxes (up to $10,000), and medical expenses in excess of 7.5% of your income.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p>Page 4</p>
    </div>
