  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="section-title">Summary of Tables</div>
    <p>You are required to provide the information requested on a form that is subject to federal tax laws. If you are required to file a tax return, you must complete and file this form will vary depending on individual circumstances. For estimated wages, see the instructions for your income tax return.</p>
    <p>If you have suggestions for making this form simpler, we would be happy to hear from you. See the instructions for your income tax return.</p>
